# UI primitives & design system (target state)

## Prefer

- Tailwind tokens from `tailwind.config.js` / `victoryPalette` (`bg`, `surface`, `primary`, `text-muted`, ...)
- Shared primitives in `src/components/common` (`Button`, `Input`, `Modal`, `Card`, `Tabs`, `Alert`, `PageSectionHeading`, ...)
- Forms via existing `useForm` or small controlled hooks - **do not introduce Formik/Yup** (deps are dead; do not revive)

## MUI

Allowed where already justified: icons, date pickers, sparse table chrome. Do not build new full screens in MUI layout primitives when a Tailwind/`common` path exists. Do not start using `@mui/x-data-grid` (unused - prefer removal over adoption).

## Modals & feedback

- Prefer `useModalState`, `ConfirmDialog`, `MessageDialog` over one-off boolean state piles
- Use `Alert` / alert context with accessible live messaging for async results

## Match diagrams

Scoring: `match-play-diagram`. Structure editing: React Flow under `event/flow` only.
